@startuml UploadAvatarSequence
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 10
skinparam maxmessagesize 100
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

title Sequence Diagram - Upload Avatar Flow

actor "User" as User
participant "Profile Page" as ProfilePage
participant "Upload Service" as UploadService
participant "Image Processor" as ImageProcessor
participant "3rd-party API\n(Cloud Storage)" as CloudAPI
participant "Profile Service" as ProfileService
participant "Database" as DB

User -> ProfilePage: Click "Chọn ảnh avatar"
activate ProfilePage
ProfilePage --> User: Mở file picker
deactivate ProfilePage

User -> ProfilePage: Chọn file ảnh từ thiết bị
activate ProfilePage
ProfilePage -> ProfilePage: Validate file\n(type, size, format)

alt File không hợp lệ
    ProfilePage --> User: Hiển thị lỗi:\n"File không đúng định dạng hoặc quá lớn"
    deactivate ProfilePage
    
else File hợp lệ
    ProfilePage --> User: Hiển thị preview ảnh
    User -> ProfilePage: Click "Upload"
    
    ProfilePage -> UploadService: POST /api/upload/avatar\n{file, userId}
    activate UploadService
    
    UploadService -> UploadService: Kiểm tra authentication
    
    UploadService -> ImageProcessor: processImage(file)
    activate ImageProcessor
    
    ImageProcessor -> ImageProcessor: Resize to 512x512
    ImageProcessor -> ImageProcessor: Compress (optimize quality)
    ImageProcessor -> ImageProcessor: Generate thumbnail 128x128
    ImageProcessor --> UploadService: {mainImage, thumbnail}
    deactivate ImageProcessor
    
    UploadService -> CloudAPI: uploadFile(mainImage)
    activate CloudAPI
    CloudAPI -> CloudAPI: Store file in bucket
    CloudAPI --> UploadService: {mainUrl, uploadId}
    deactivate CloudAPI
    
    UploadService -> CloudAPI: uploadFile(thumbnail)
    activate CloudAPI
    CloudAPI -> CloudAPI: Store thumbnail
    CloudAPI --> UploadService: {thumbnailUrl}
    deactivate CloudAPI
    
    UploadService -> ProfileService: updateAvatar(userId, mainUrl, thumbnailUrl)
    activate ProfileService
    
    ProfileService -> DB: SELECT avatarUrl FROM users WHERE id = userId
    activate DB
    DB --> ProfileService: oldAvatarUrl
    deactivate DB
    
    ProfileService -> DB: UPDATE users SET avatarUrl = mainUrl,\navatarThumbnail = thumbnailUrl\nWHERE id = userId
    activate DB
    DB --> ProfileService: Updated successfully
    deactivate DB
    
    alt Có avatar cũ
        ProfileService -> CloudAPI: deleteFile(oldAvatarUrl)
        activate CloudAPI
        CloudAPI --> ProfileService: File deleted
        deactivate CloudAPI
    end
    
    ProfileService --> UploadService: {success: true, avatarUrl: mainUrl}
    deactivate ProfileService
    
    UploadService --> ProfilePage: 200 OK\n{avatarUrl, thumbnailUrl}
    deactivate UploadService
    
    ProfilePage -> ProfilePage: Cập nhật hiển thị avatar mới
    ProfilePage --> User: Hiển thị thông báo:\n"Cập nhật avatar thành công"
    deactivate ProfilePage
end

note right of CloudAPI
  **3rd-party Cloud Storage:**
  - AWS S3
  - Cloudinary
  - Firebase Storage
  - Azure Blob Storage
  
  Trả về public URL để truy cập
end note

note left of ImageProcessor
  **Image Processing:**
  - Resize: 512x512 (main)
  - Thumbnail: 128x128
  - Format: WebP/PNG/JPG
  - Max size: 5MB
  - Compression: 80% quality
end note

@enduml
